# wmem adaptation inventory: path, bucket, purpose.
# The allocator patch is wireshark-4.6.8-0001-wmem-sublet-lifetimes.patch.
patches/wireshark-4.6.8-0001-wmem-sublet-lifetimes.patch allocator block and block_fast objects as child lifetimes of their blocks (CDERIVE/CREVOKE)
src/shared/shim/glib.h compat the GLib surface wmem uses, mapped onto port services
src/shared/shim/wsutil/ws_assert.h compat scope assertions kept active
src/shared/system.c compat g_malloc, g_free and g_realloc as the process's malloc, counted
src/shared/compat.c compat no allocator override from the environment; the core's hashing seed
src/shared/scopes.c test the dissection-loop pool lifecycle modelled on upstream's scope layer
src/shared/main.c test the replay driver
src/shared/replay.c test event validation and synthetic payload checks across all four allocators
examples/wmem.c test the link example the shared CheriBSD harness runs
src/shared/port.h test the replay's trace format and the port's services
src/shared/scopes.h test the scope layer's interface
src/shared/shim/config.h compat the configuration header the upstream units include
src/shared/shim/ws_attributes.h compat attribute macros the upstream units use
src/shared/shim/ws_posix_compat.h compat an empty stand-in for a header the upstream units include
src/shared/shim/ws_symbol_export.h compat export macros the upstream units use
